# 5. 🔄 Core Workflows (Sequence Flows)

## 5.1 Primary Flow
1. User logs in via Client -> API Gateway -> User Management Service
2. User requests inventory update -> API Gateway -> Inventory Service
3. Inventory Service fetches data from Cache or Database, updates if necessary
4. Updated data returned to Client

## 5.2 Secondary Flow (If Needed)
- Historical data retrieval: Client -> API Gateway -> Inventory Service -> Database

## 5.3 Failure Flow (Very important)
- Failed request: Retry up to 3 times -> Circuit breaker opens -> Failover to secondary region

